| `c_secret_scan_call` | O(#toks) — same | **0** (`depth: Int`) |
| `c_emit_println` token refuse | O(#toks in args) — now **past** nested `)` | `"__sec__"+sn` once/ident (**existing**) |
| `c_secret_emit_guard` + `c_guard_scan_idents` | Θ(\|args\|²) `char_at` | one `str_slice` / ident (7.1 floor) |
| `c_emit_call_args` join | O(\|joined\|²) concat | growing `args` **once per free-call** (adjacent) |
| New join in `c_emit_println` | — | **still forbidden** |

